Start by inspecting the project environment and establishing the implementation plan. Then build the actual website in the working project, validate each major feature, and continue through the full acceptance checklist.

Final objective: Create a cohesive, premium, conversion-focused marketing website that combines the creativity of an award-winning interactive agency with the maintainability of a professional CMS-driven web platform. The website must be fully multi-page, content-editable, responsive, accessible, and functional—not merely visually impressive.